rem Convergents of e
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=65
rem Digit sum of the numerator of the
rem 100th convergent of e

use linalg
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Count integer = 100

rem The numerator is the continuant of
rem the terms 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 4, ...: the
rem determinant of a tridiagonal matrix
rem with the terms on the diagonal.
K = 1 till Count array
Third' = (K + 1) mod 3 equal 0
Big' = (K + 1) * 2 // 3
Rest' = Third choose Big 1
Terms = concat (array 2) Rest
Ones = array shape (Count - 1) fill 1
Up' = Ones diag 1
Down' = Ones diag -1
Grid' = (Terms diag) + Up - Down
Num = Grid det
Answer = Num text integer rank 0 sum
Answer print
